Import //demos/features/features.reelpreset
Launch ~/Projects/musicbox/build/App/Musicbox.app
Output //docs/landing/features/intro-outro.gif
Set Size 1440x900
Set IntroBackground //design/motion/intro-reel-2s-16x9.mp4
Set OutroBackground //design/motion/outro-reel-2s-16x9.mp4
Intro@crossfade,ease-out,500ms 2s
Outro@fade,600ms 2s
Hide
Wait #lanes
Show
Sleep 1.5s
